To test the usability of the simulator, the authors created a pipeline which includes driving sessions with various diﬃculty elements (Fig. 5). Firstly, the subject was required to use the simulator for the ﬁrst time to both drive in an empty parking and to follow a leading vehicle for 2 min keeping a speed of 40 Km/h (familiarization phase). The protocol consisted of a free ride ses-

